task.create_book_summary {
  action (completed) {
    next to "Highligh text to look up", add a "Summarize" button, when click {
      Map: Split the original book content (not the simplified one) into chunks with 300 words per chunk. Ask the model to summarize each chunk individually.
      Reduce: Take all those "mini-summaries," combine them, and ask the model to create a final summary of the summaries.
      The final summary should be 300 words long.

      After generating the summary, cache it to ./cache/pg{book_id}/summary.txt
    }
  }
}

